module System

### The kind of a record or entity whose `represent()` is the one the builder derives: the type writes no `represent`
### of its own, so its text is its type name and its member variables. A type switch tests it (`when T` with
### `is DerivedDisplay`): a derived `diagnose()` writes a member of such a type the same way, with each of its member
### variables in its diagnose form (`Tag(name: "left")`). No type writes `obeys DerivedDisplay`: the builder decides it
### from the type. It has no required routines.
protocol DerivedDisplay
